  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{x}_{1}=\\mathrm{a} \\sin \\left(\\omega \\mathrm{t}+\\phi_{1}\\right), \\mathrm{x}_{2}=\\mathrm{a} \\sin \\left(\\omega \\mathrm{t}+\\phi_{2}\\right)$\r\n\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\quad\\left|\\mathrm{x}_{1}-\\mathrm{x}_{2}\\right|=2 \\mathrm{a} \\sin \\left(\\omega \\mathrm{t}+\\frac{\\phi_{1}+\\phi_{2}}{2}\\right) \\cos \\left(\\frac{\\phi_{1}-\\phi_{2}}{2}\\right)$\r\n\r\nTomaximize $\\left|\\mathrm{x}_{1}-\\mathrm{x}_{2}\\right|: \\sin \\left(\\omega \\mathrm{t}+\\frac{\\phi_{1}+\\phi_{2}}{2}\\right)=1$\r\n\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\mathrm{a} \\sqrt{2}=2 \\mathrm{a} \\times 1 \\times \\cos \\left(\\frac{\\phi_{1}-\\phi_{2}}{2}\\right)$\r\n\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}=\\cos \\left(\\frac{\\phi_{1}-\\phi_{2}}{2}\\right) \\Rightarrow \\frac{\\pi}{4}=\\frac{\\phi_{1}-\\phi_{2}}{2}$\r\n\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\phi_{1}-\\phi_{2}=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$",
